<title>USA: Fed says overnight system repo totaled $3.450 bln.</title>
<headline>Fed says overnight system repo totaled $3.450 bln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve added a total of $3.450 bilion during its overnight system repurchase agreement operation on Tuesday, a New York Fed spokesman said.</p>
<p>(( -- E. Freilich, N.A. Treasury Desk 212-859-1679 ))</p>
